 r←Test_TableEdit_003(stopFlag batchFlag);parms;n;⎕TRAP;table;rowTitles
⍝ Inserting rows, including syncing with "data" property.
 r←∆Inactive
 :Return

 r←∆Failed
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')

⍝⍝⍝ Preconditions
 table←⍉⊃('Obama' 'Bush' 'Clinton' 'Reagan' 'Kennedy' 'Carter')(1 0 1 0 1 1)(20150102 20150630 20151231)(1 2 235659)
 parms←#._APLGUI.GUI.Table.CreateParms
 parms.posn←35 25
 parms.size←400 600
 parms.colTitles←'Name' 'Democrat' 'Date' 'Time'
 parms.dataTypes←#._APLGUI.GUI.Enums.TableDataTypes.(Character Numeric Date Time)
 parms.addToCaption←'Testing Table.Run'
 parms.confirmQuit←0
 parms.data←1 100×⍤1⊣1 1\6 1⍴1+⍳6
 parms.testMode←1

 n←#._APLGUI.GUI.Table.Create table #._APLGUI.GUI.APLGuiGlobalParms.CreateDefaults parms
 #._APLGUI.GUI.Table.ExecPrivateFns'RowInsert'n             ⍝ Insert one row before the first one
 →GoToTidyUp(⍴n.Grid.Values)≢1 0+⍴table
 →GoToTidyUp 0 0≢n.∆data[0;]                        ⍝ Is ∆data kept in sync?
 →GoToTidyUp n.Grid.Values[0;2]≢2 ⎕NQ #'DateToIDN'(3↑⎕TS)  ⍝ Inserted line should carry today's date
 →GoToTidyUp(⌊n.Grid.Values[0;3]÷10)≢⌊(24 60 60⊥3↑3↓⎕TS)÷10 ⍝ Inserted line should carry "now" as time - roughly

 #._APLGUI.GUI.Table.ExecPrivateFns'RowInsert'(n(↑⍴n.Grid.Values)1) ⍝ Insert one row after the last one
 →GoToTidyUp(⍴n.Grid.Values)≢2 0+⍴table
 →GoToTidyUp 0 0≢n.∆data[¯1+↑⍴n.∆data;]             ⍝ Is ∆data kept in sync?

 #._APLGUI.GUI.Table.ExecPrivateFns'RowInsert'(n 2 2)       ⍝ Insert two rows after the third one
 →GoToTidyUp(⍴n.Grid.Values)≢4 0+⍴table
 →GoToTidyUp n.Grid.Values[;1]≢0 1 0 0 0 1 0 1 1 0
 →GoToTidyUp(2 2⍴0 0)≢n.∆data[2+⍳2;]
 →GoToTidyUp≢/↑¨⍴¨n.Grid.Values n.∆data             ⍝ Is ∆data kept in sync?

 r←∆OK

∆TidyUp:
 n.∆CloseForm
